WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.390
Fidio yii ṣe alaye bi o ṣe le lo Arclight lati ṣe imupadabọ pupa fundal nipa yiyan eto ina didan julọ.

2
00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:16.650
Rii daju pe agbeko lẹnsi wa ni oke, nibiti ko si agbara lẹnsi ni iho oju.

3
00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:22.010
Ni ipari apa, ṣe akiyesi ifasilẹ ni oju mejeeji ni akoko kanna.

4
00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:26.750
Ṣe afiwe imọlẹ ati awọ laarin awọn oju meji.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:35.290
Ni idanwo deede, ko yẹ ki o jẹ iyatọ gbogbogbo ni imọlẹ ati awọ laarin awọn oju meji.

6
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:42.120
Ni funfun ati awọn ọmọ Asia, ifasilẹ le wo diẹ sii osan ati ofeefee.

7
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:50.500
Awọn ifarahan wọnyi tun jẹ deede bi awọ gbogbogbo ati imọlẹ jẹ kanna laarin awọn oju meji.

8
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:58.980
Ifesisilẹ ajeji jẹ nigbati itarara, iyatọ gidi wa ninu imọlẹ ati awọ laarin awọn oju meji.

9
00:00:59.380 --> 00:01:10.890
Eyi le jẹ afihan igun inu ti a ti nipo, alemo dudu ti o wa laarin ifasilẹ ti oju kan tabi oju mejeeji, tabi ifasilẹ pupa ti ko si patapata.

10
00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:25.670
Idanwo reflex ajeji le ṣe afihan wiwa cataract, retinoblastoma, aleebu corneal, squint, tabi aṣiṣe ifasilẹ.

11
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:29.970
Gbogbo eyi nilo atunyẹwo siwaju nipasẹ alamọja.
